OL,3,APM to warn EU chief of 'damage' posed
OL,4,Aby Made in Europe scheme
OL,5,
OL,6,FAndy Burnham has warned of the
OL,7,F"collateral damage" posed by the EU's
OL,8,FMade In Europe rules, ahead of a
OL,9,Fmeeting later with European Commission
OL,10,FPresident Ursula von der Leyen during a
OL,11,FUN summit in New York.
OL,13,FThe proposals aim to curb the presence
OL,14,Fof Chinese companies in the EU by
OL,15,Fgiving manufacturers inside the bloc
OL,16,Fpriority for public contracts and
OL,17,Fsubsidies.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,307,300,200,140,0,100
