OL,3,APM to warn EU chief of 'damage' posed
OL,4,Aby Made in Europe scheme
OL,5,
OL,6,FSpeaking on the flight to the US,
OL,7,FBurnham also declined to rule out
OL,8,Fcommitting to rejoining the EU in
OL,9,FLabour's next manifesto, saying it was
OL,10,Fan issue "for another day".
OL,12,FHe said his "immediate priority" was to
OL,13,Frebuild the relationship with the EU
OL,14,Fand reach "practical agreement that
OL,15,Fwill further boost the British
OL,16,Feconomy".
